# ArticleSummaryCard

## Purpose
A distinctive key-points box for article TL;DR sections and AI Overview optimization. Place near the top of an article with 3–5 takeaways.

## Props
| Prop | Type | Required | Default | Description |
|------|------|----------|---------|-------------|
