# ArticleResourceDownload

Resource download CTA for PDFs, templates, and guides. Place mid-article after establishing value.

**File:** `app/articles/ArticleResourceDownload.tsx`

## Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `topic` | `string` | Yes | — | Topic for the dynamic title |
| `title` | `string` | No | `"{topic} Checklist & Notes"` | Custom title |
| `description` | `string` | No | `"Download a practical checklist and notes for your next project."` | Custom description |
